      "id": "claim_a12d2b62df2247308830e8d78296bbba",
      "statement": "POST /api/sessions/:id/spawn-child creates ~/.many-ai-cli/orchestration/<orchestration_id>/board.md, injects the board path into the new child's prompt, and watches the board for appended progress plus a ## DONE <role> session=<child_id> completion marker; by default each child runs in its own git worktree under .many-ai-cli/worktrees/<orchestration_id>/<role> when the parent cwd is a git repository, and the Hub never auto-merges a child's branch.",
