      "id": "claim_60d9505a5e7e42848cf3b3aa61269528",
      "statement": "Child sessions default to full permission bypass (orchestration.child_full_bypass, default true) for unattended work: a Codex child starts with --sandbox danger-full-access --ask-for-approval never and the others start in their own CLI's bypass-permissions equivalent; a conductor's own spawn action still waits for human confirmation by default (orchestration.spawn_confirm_mode), but relay children skip that confirmation by design, and completion depends on the child writing the DONE marker with no job DAG, retry queue, or automatic merge.",
