    {
      "id": "claim_f5989f3268364c96b5c4ed98ae5dc8be",
      "statement": "internal/orchestrate's package doc states its purpose is letting the AI inside a conductor session spawn or message a child session without ever handling curl or the Hub token directly; authentication and self-session-id resolution are closed inside the command via wrapper-injected environment variables (MANY_AI_CLI_HUB_PORT, MANY_AI_CLI_SESSION_ID, MANY_AI_CLI_HUB_TOKEN), and the AI itself only ever supplies role/prompt and optionally provider/model.",
